OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FChance of
OL,6,Fsome showers at first but otherwise
OL,7,Flargely dry through this evening and
OL,8,Fovernight with variable cloud and
OL,9,Fclear spells. Some light showers again
OL,10,Fin the west by morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FVariable cloud and bright or
OL,13,Fsunny spells through the day. Mostly
OL,14,Fdry but the odd light shower. Turning
OL,15,Fcloudier later with outbreaks of light
OL,16,Frain spreading east.
